8,Central Nicobarese,https://docs.verbix.com/EndangeredLanguages/CentralNicobarese,"Language: Central Nicobarese. Alternate names: Muöt, Nicobarese, Nancowry, Zentraler Dialekt, Nicobarese, Central. Language code: ncb. Language family: Austro-Asiatic, Mon-Khmer, Nicobar, Nancowry (SIL classification). Number of speakers: 10,100. Vulnerability: Vulnerable.","Nicobarese, Central",Austro-Asiatic
